Evaluation Criteria (Total: 10 points)

[2 pts] Correctly identifies the storage layers involved
        (block, LV, filesystem, mount)

[2 pts] Diagnoses the inconsistency without unnecessary changes

[2 pts] Applies the correct fix at the appropriate layer

[2 pts] Ensures no data loss and minimal intervention

[1 pt ] Configuration persists after reboot simulation

[1 pt ] Uses safe and professional practices
        (no disabling security, no destructive commands)
